        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Giovanni Polese, Giuseppe Verdi\n- Roles: opera singer, opera composer\n- Topics: French repertoire, German repertoire, Italian repertoire, Verdi operas\n\nFacts:\n- Giuseppe Verdi, born Giuseppe Fortunino Francesco Verdi, was an Italian opera composer who lived from 9 or 10 October 1813 to 27 January 1901.\n- Giovanni Polese sang a broad repertoire drawn from the French, German, and Italian traditions.\n- Giovanni Polese was most celebrated for his performances in the operas of Giuseppe Verdi.",
